### Test RoomService API with Repository Pattern

### 1. Check Storage Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room/storage-type

### 2. Get All Rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room

### 3. Get Room by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room/1

### 4. Search Room by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room/search?roomName=Deluxe Suite

### 5. Create New Room (Database/XML)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/room
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomName": "Executive Suite",
  "imageUrl": "/images/executive.jpg",
  "description": "Luxurious executive suite with city view",
  "amenities": "King Bed,Wi-Fi,Jacuzzi,Mini Bar,City View",
  "isDefault": false,
  "price": "399.99",
  "numberOfRooms": 3
}

### 6. Create Room with Amenities List (will be converted to comma-separated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/room
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomName": "Presidential Suite",
  "imageUrl": "/images/presidential.jpg",
  "description": "Ultimate luxury with panoramic views",
  "amenities": "King Bed,Wi-Fi,Jacuzzi,Mini Bar,Ocean View,Private Balcony,Butler Service",
  "isDefault": false,
  "price": "599.99",
  "numberOfRooms": 2
}

### 7. Update Room
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/room/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "roomName": "Updated Deluxe Suite",
  "imageUrl": "/images/deluxe-updated.jpg",
  "description": "Updated luxurious room with enhanced amenities",
  "amenities": "King Bed,Wi-Fi,Jacuzzi,Mini Bar,Smart TV",
  "isDefault": true,
  "price": "349.99",
  "numberOfRooms": 5
}

### 8. Delete Room
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/room/3

### 9. Test Thread Safety (Concurrent Requests)
# This demonstrates thread-safe I/O operations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/room

### Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:5238 